# NOTE ON data/ and model/:
# The generated dataset (data/house_prices.csv) and the trained model
# (model/house_price_model.pkl) are INTENTIONALLY NOT ignored here.
#
# Streamlit Community Cloud only runs "app.py" when deploying - it does
# NOT run generate_dataset.py or train_model.py automatically. If those
# output files were excluded from GitHub, the deployed app would crash
# with a "model not found" error.
#
# For this beginner-friendly setup, commit data/house_prices.csv and
# model/house_price_model.pkl to GitHub so the app works immediately
# after deployment. See README.md for details.
